      "side": 1,
      "message": "could you explain the motivation and impact of this change? I fully believe that creating buffers over and over for the blit is expensive. It would be useful to know what the cost is, and if it\u0027s particularly bad on some APIs/OSes, etc.",
      "revId": "6dc1193f817b6b8f7ec4e73d0846a119dcf5755b",
