      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T05:24:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reusing buffers is always better than repeatedly creating buffers, right? The latter is what we are doing in the blit.\n\nDo you mean it should be mentioned in the commit message or there should be a proof that repeatedly creating buffers are bad?",
      "parentUuid": "3b6f19a4_006be463",
      "revId": "6dc1193f817b6b8f7ec4e73d0846a119dcf5755b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
