      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T01:09:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "using the pendingSerial here isn\u0027t going to be safe because there is no guaranatee the command encoder you\u0027re recording will be submitted in that serial. You could submit another one ahead of it in which case the serial will advance and the buffer could get recycled.\n\ninstead you need to track the buffer only after the command buffer is submitted.",
