      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T01:09:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what if the buffer manager returns to you a pair of Buffer, and the size is actually created it as. (you can also just use GetSize(), but returning the size makes it a bit more obvious you might get something not equal to what you asked for).\n\nThen, the calling code can make sure to size it as a full-size write based on the returned size.\n\nmaybe the LRU can have a parameter for maxBufferSize so it doesn\u0027t give you something too large.",
